caption:
@kalshisports knows Wemby and friends are coming out hot 🔥 Victor Wembanyama and Chet Holmgren are the two most extraordinary centers in professional basketball and the Western Conference Finals is giving the sport the individual matchup it has been waiting for since both of them entered the league — two generational big men operating at the peak of their abilities with the NBA Finals on the line and everything each of them has built pointing toward this exact moment.

Wembanyama has been the best player in these playoffs by any honest accounting. Forty-one points and twenty-four rebounds in double overtime to steal Game 1. Twenty-one points, seventeen rebounds, six assists, and four blocks in a losing Game 2 effort — a performance that would have been the signature moment of almost any other player’s series and got somewhat overshadowed by a 76-23 bench scoring disadvantage that had nothing to do with anything he did. He is doing things in a playoff setting that the sport has genuinely never seen at his age — protecting the rim, hitting logo threes, carrying a roster without their starting point guard in the biggest game of the year and making it look like the most natural thing in the world.

#nbaplayoffs #basketball #wembanyama

@nisiopticsusa just launched their latest Aeureus T1.4 cinema lenses with a 46mm image circle. These lenses work on full frame, super35 AND medium format sensors like the one of the GFX.

They're clinically sharp and have some awesome swirly bokeh on the edges. The set of lenses is consistent in size, weight and format so that they're easy to swap out without having to adjust your video rig.

#cameragear #cinemaphotography #cameras #nisi #cameralens #cinemalens #agphotog #phototips

The FIRST autofocus anamorphic in the world

@blazarlens.official just teased the new Apex line , an AF 1.3x S35 anamorphic. And at first I wasn’t thrilled at the 1.3x but after seeing it, it really gives a 1.5x look with the barrel distortion and bokeh. 

What are your thoughts???

